# ---- ML / data ----
# Raw datasets (handwritten/printed OCR images + medicine reference CSV) are
# intentionally NOT committed here -- they're ~65MB and don't need to churn
# through git history. Get them via the data+model bundle described in
# ml/README.md (built by scripts/package_ocr_bundle.sh) instead.
ml/data/raw/*
ml/data/processed/*
ml/models/*
!ml/data/raw/.gitkeep
!ml/data/processed/.gitkeep
!ml/models/.gitkeep
*.h5
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.pkl
*.joblib
# The trained handwritten-word classifier IS committed (~38MB, compressed):
# unlike the raw datasets, the whole point of committing it is so the app
# works out of the box without a separate training/download step.
!ml/models/handwritten_medicine_classifier.joblib
!ml/models/handwritten_medicine_classifier.metrics.json
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- Editors and OS ----
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Logs and temp ----
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/

# ---- Cohort administration (not for the shared repo) ----
# The intern roster spreadsheet carries 26 people's personal email addresses.
# Branch assignments live in .github/interns.yml instead, without the emails.
*.xlsx
